  ('qml_facts_childhood', 'Facts', 'Gradgrind''s opening schoolroom speech', 'Hard Times', 'Thomas Gradgrind', 'capitalised abstract noun and imperative pedagogy', 'childhood', 'eq_ht_at_children_roles_20260524', 'stem_childhood_method_ao2', 'Capitalisation makes an abstraction behave like doctrine, reducing education to command.', 'Briony''s desire to order the world into story in Atonement.', 'verified quotation', 'teacher review required', 'ChatGPT session, 24 May 2026', 'annotated essay practice', false, '2026-05-24T00:00:00.000Z', '2026-05-24T00:00:00.000Z'),
